'''August Gauntlet II''' (続・8月強襲！, ''Zoku・8 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''Continued・August Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during August and was added in the [[Version 10.7 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Ghostly Strangers (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Strangers]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
August Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Strangers Lvs''' (Uターン Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Strangers Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[August Gauntlet II/Strangers Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*August Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]] and [[Ghostly Strangers (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Strangers]].

